LUMA SUMMARY:
Continuation of the Sir-Tech story. Cozmo recounts his obsession with getting the Wizardry editor running on his own Apple II, reviewing incoming game submissions, seeing unreleased/early software, and interacting with the broader 1980s game-development world. The chapter closes for a break after another stretch of highly specific personal recollection.
